225-                  were determined using adsorption data of the adsorption isotherms of N2 at −196 °C
226-                  and calculated by the Brunauer–Emmet–Teller (BET) equation (Brunauer et al. 1938).
227:                  For biochar and post harvest soil samples, NH4NO3 (1 M) extractable fraction of Cd was
